      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good high-level overview. For the piece, I want to go a bit deeper. Could you elaborate on the specific scientific evidence or mechanisms that proponents use to justify mandates, and then on the other side, what are the specific legal or philosophical frameworks that civil liberties advocates use to argue against them? I want to make sure I'm not just hitting the surface level.",
